# Playwright E2E (Top Mining)

## Structure

- Tests in **JavaScript** under `tests/`
- Helpers in `tests/helpers/` — `gotoApp()`, `installApiMocks()`, `gotoStory()`, fixtures
- Name files by **system area**: `home.spec.js`, `calculator.spec.js`, `navigation.spec.js`
- Storybook specs in `tests/storybook/`
- Group with `test.describe`; use descriptive Russian test names

## Auth

- Top Mining has no login — do not use `storageState` / auth setup

## Locators

1. Prefer `getByRole`, then `getByLabel`, `getByPlaceholder`, `getByText`
2. Avoid CSS classes and test IDs unless no semantic alternative

## API

- Mock only Nitro `/api/*` paths in `installApiMocks` — explicit routes, never `**/api/**`
- Use `gotoApp(page, path)` — mocks enabled by default; `{ mockApi: false }` for static pages

## Writing tests

- Assert user-visible behavior; use web-first assertions (`toBeVisible`, `toHaveURL`)
- Shared setup in `beforeEach`; no shared mutable state between tests
- Use `gotoApp()` / `gotoStory()`; avoid `page.evaluate()` and explicit sleeps

## Projects

- `app` — Nuxt dev server `:3010` (`PLAYWRIGHT_APP_PORT`)
- `storybook` — Storybook `:6010` (`PLAYWRIGHT_STORYBOOK_PORT`), iframe via `gotoStory(storyId)`

Docs: `docs/testing.md`

## Example

```javascript
import { test, expect } from '@playwright/test';
import { gotoApp } from './helpers/index.js';

test.describe('Майнинг-калькулятор', () => {
  test.beforeEach(async ({ page }) => {
    await gotoApp(page, '/calculator');
  });

  test('отображает форму калькулятора', async ({ page }) => {
    await expect(
      page.getByRole('region', { name: 'Калькулятор доходности' }),
    ).toBeVisible();
  });
});
```
